# Approved design documentation.
#
# Prettier exists so that diffs contain only semantic changes
# (00-Project-Foundation.md 11.3). On markdown prose it does the opposite:
# it repads entire tables when a single word changes, which would bury real
# edits to frozen documents under thousands of whitespace-only lines.
# Measured cost when this was evaluated: 872 changed lines in one document,
# zero content difference.
#
# Prettier owns code formatting. Markdown prose is reviewed by a human.
